flowchart TD
  yt[YouTube Videos] --> fetch[Fetch audio and captions]

  prominent[Enrollment: Prominent Videos] --> candidates[Diarize sampled Windows into Candidate Voices]
  candidates --> cut{{Voice cut questions: same person?}}
  cut --> voice[Group into Voices]
  voice --> confirm{{Enrollment Question: who is this Voice?}}
  confirm --> clips[Enrollment Clips]
  clips --> voiceprints[Voiceprints]

  subgraph identification [Identification]
    windows[Windows of 20 min or less] --> diarizer[Diarizer: Turns per Cluster]
    diarizer --> embedder[Embedder: one embedding per single-voice Turn]
    embedder --> match[Match each Cluster against Voiceprints]
    match --> band{Thresholds}
    band -->|in between| review[review]
    band -->|top score >= high| person[Person]
    band -->|top score < low| unknown[unknown]
  end

  subgraph labeling [Labeling]
    question{{Review Question: who is this?}} --> labels[Label Files]
    labels --> calibrate[Calibrate with impostor passes]
    labels --> evaluation[Evaluation Run: metrics and plots]
  end

  fetch --> prominent
  fetch --> windows
  voiceprints --> match
  review --> question
  calibrate --> band

  person --> timeline[Timeline HTML]
  unknown --> timeline
  review --> timeline
